{
  "rule": "The targets of a substance are the union of the base and API lists. A target found under two severities, in one source or across both, keeps the higher one (dangerous over unsafe over uncertain), and the conflict is reported. When both sources list targets, a target that only one source has is reported; when one source lists none at all, that is one finding.",
